<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:20:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</link><description>由于科技股再度下跌，削弱了投资者对风险资产的兴趣，美国国债周三全线上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment'&gt;科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasury Yields Sink to Two-Month Low as Stocks Rout Intensifies&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:49:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>秘鲁力争在年底前解决非正式采矿纠纷</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/peru-races-to-resolve-informal-mining-fight-by-year-end-deadline</link><description>秘鲁正在竞相在年底截止日期前彻底修改管理数以万计的非正规采矿者的规定，政府警告说，否则可能会在一夜之间将他们推向非法状态。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/peru-races-to-resolve-informal-mining-fight-by-year-end-deadline'&gt;秘鲁力争在年底前解决非正式采矿纠纷&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Peru Races to Resolve Informal Mining Fight by Year-End Deadline&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/peru-races-to-resolve-informal-mining-fight-by-year-end-deadline</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:55:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>萨尔瓦多终于从打击帮派中获得经济收益</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/el-salvador-finally-reaps-economic-gains-from-gang-crackdown</link><description>萨尔瓦多的经济命运终于开始与其安全状况的显着改善相匹配。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/el-salvador-finally-reaps-economic-gains-from-gang-crackdown'&gt;萨尔瓦多终于从打击帮派中获得经济收益&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：El Salvador Finally Reaps Economic Gains From Gang Crackdown&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/el-salvador-finally-reaps-economic-gains-from-gang-crackdown</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:55:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>雷斯塔称，俄罗斯炼油厂运行跌至数十年来最低水平</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says</link><description>Rystad Energy表示，随着乌克兰继续袭击炼油厂，俄罗斯的石油加工率已降至二十多年来的最低水平，给该国国内燃料供应带来压力。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says'&gt;雷斯塔称，俄罗斯炼油厂运行跌至数十年来最低水平&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Russian Refinery Runs Drop to Lowest in Decades, Rystad Says&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:38:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国陆军引爆爱荷华州米德尔敦的爆炸物储藏室</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/us-army-detonates-explosives-cache-in-middletown-iowa-video</link><description>美国陆军炸毁了储存在爱荷华州一处设施中的五吨危险材料，早期迹象表明规划者已经避免了出现大量有毒铅云的最坏情况。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/us-army-detonates-explosives-cache-in-middletown-iowa-video'&gt;美国陆军引爆爱荷华州米德尔敦的爆炸物储藏室&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Army Detonates Explosives Cache in Middletown, Iowa&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/us-army-detonates-explosives-cache-in-middletown-iowa-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:11:46 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>